{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>混有俄羅斯與烏克蘭血統的美國女模Ella Orten，不時於社交網站分享性感相，其中她穿上銀色比堅尼於露台拍照，舉起雙臂撥弄長髮，擺出各種誘人甫士，留言表示：「非常美好。」有網友留言表示：「好正嘅比堅尼身材，同埋美麗嘅胳肋底！」</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:06.243749+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T14:01:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:31.969480+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:32:31.969480+00:00","content_hash":"99b5419f424fffc939d4ef74a3d35ecbc1dc78c4def15127ba36e4ed7a0836f1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}